---
import { timeLabel } from '../../lib/viewings/calendar';
const timeOptions = Array.from({ length: 97 }, (_, i) => `${String(Math.floor(i / 4)).padStart(2, '0')}:${String((i % 4) * 15).padStart(2, '0')}`);
import ViewingLayout from '../../layouts/ViewingLayout.astro';
---
<ViewingLayout title="Owner availability · sample">
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">OWNER AVAILABILITY · SAMPLE</p><h1>Plan ahead.<br /><em>Make time your own.</em></h1><p>Browse any month. Block a day, individual slots, or recurring time ranges. Sample changes are shared with visitor previews in this browser.</p><a href="/owner/demo">← Owner dashboard</a></section>
<div id="availability-app" class="two-col"><section class="card"><div class="calendar-nav"><button class="text-button" id="previous-month" type="button">← Previous</button><label for="owner-month">Month<input id="owner-month" type="month" /></label><button class="text-button" id="next-month" type="button">Next →</button></div><button class="text-button" id="today-month" type="button">Back to this month</button><div class="calendar-grid" id="owner-calendar" role="group" aria-label="Owner availability calendar"></div><p class="hint">Choose a day. All times are Eastern. Sample showing hours: 9 AM–5 PM.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2 id="owner-selected-day"></h2><p id="day-state"></p><button class="button secondary" id="toggle-day" type="button">Block entire day</button><div class="slot-tiles" id="owner-slots"></div><h3>Requests for this day</h3><div id="day-bookings"></div><p id="availability-result" role="status"></p></section>
<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">DEFAULT BLOCKS</p><h2>Keep recurring time free.</h2><p>Add as many blocked ranges as needed. They repeat each week, including months beyond the visitor calendar.</p><form id="rule-form"><label for="rule-weekday">Day</label><select id="rule-weekday"><option value="-1">Every day</option>{['Sunday','Monday','Tuesday','Wednesday','Thursday','Friday','Saturday'].map((d,i)=><option value={i}>{d}</option>)}</select><div class="field-pair"><div><label for="rule-start">Start</label><select id="rule-start" required>{timeOptions.slice(0, -1).map(time => <option value={time} selected={time === '12:00'}>{timeLabel(time)}</option>)}</select></div><div><label for="rule-end">End</label><select id="rule-end" required>{timeOptions.slice(1).map(time => <option value={time} selected={time === '13:00'}>{timeLabel(time)}</option>)}</select></div></div><button class="button" type="submit">Add default block</button><p id="rule-error" role="status"></p></form><ul id="rule-list"></ul><p class="hint">Overlapping slots are blocked. Individually unblocking a slot overrides a default range for that date; an entire-day block takes precedence.</p></section>
<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">NOTIFICATIONS · SAMPLE OUTBOX</p><h2>Keep visitors informed.</h2><ul id="notice-list"></ul></section></div>
<dialog id="cancel-warning" aria-labelledby="cancel-warning-title"><form id="cancel-warning-form"><h2 id="cancel-warning-title">This change affects bookings.</h2><p id="affected-bookings"></p><label for="cancellation-reason">Reason to include in the cancellation email</label><textarea id="cancellation-reason" required minlength="5" maxlength="1000"></textarea><label class="check"><input id="notify-visitors" type="checkbox" required /> I agree to notify each affected visitor at their registered email and cancel these bookings.</label><div class="actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Cancel bookings and apply block</button><button id="keep-bookings" class="button secondary" type="button">Keep bookings unchanged</button></div><p class="hint">Preview only: records and notification drafts are saved in this browser. No emails or lock commands are sent. Live operation must confirm PIN revocation and email delivery.</p></form></dialog>
<script>import '../../scripts/owner-availability';</script>
</ViewingLayout>
